--!strict
--[[
	SimpleAdmin v4 — compact shell + live theme engine
	Client script. Run in an executor, or as a LocalScript under StarterPlayerScripts.

	Window is 280x356 by default. Header drags. Minimize drops to a 46px orb.
	The Theme page re-colours everything live: accent RGB, background RGB,
	window opacity, row opacity, corner radius, UI scale, blur.

	Server commands are not here on purpose — this build is client-side only.
]]

